# Rules are matched top-to-bottom, first match wins — the specific Wix
# redirects MUST come before the SPA catch-all below, or /* would always
# win first and these would never be reached.

# Known Wix -> this-app path differences + one indexed duplicate
# (docs/ADMIN_PANEL_PLAN.md §9). Dormant until DNS actually points at this
# Cloudflare Pages project — harmless before then.
/what-s-on    /whats-on      301
/partyvenue   /party-venue   301
/contact-us   /contact       301
/menu-1       /menu          301

# SPA fallback — Cloudflare Pages equivalent of vercel.json's filesystem+
# rewrite behavior. Real static assets and /api/* Functions are resolved
# before _redirects is ever consulted, so this only catches paths that are
# neither.
/*    /index.html   200
